<section class="py-16">
  <h2 class="wedding-display mb-8 text-center text-3xl">A little about us</h2>

  <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <% [
         { src: image_path("wedding/us.JPEG"), alt: "Aruni and Nick", caption: "The duo" },
         { src: image_path("wedding/proposal.JPEG"), alt: "The proposal", caption: "The proposal" },
         { src: image_path("wedding/jub.JPEG"), alt: "Jub, our cat",  caption: "Jub who (unfortunately) is not invited." }
       ].each do |photo| %>
      <figure class="card overflow-hidden bg-base-200">
        <img src="<%= photo[:src] %>" alt="<%= photo[:alt] %>" loading="lazy"
             class="aspect-square w-full object-cover">
        <figcaption class="p-4 text-sm text-base-content/70"><%= photo[:caption] %></figcaption>
      </figure>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-center text-base-content/80">
    We met at Info-Tech, on the Aqua team. We both did our co-ops
    there and went to Fanshawe &mdash; I was just five years early. Jub moved
    in two weeks before Aruni, so technically the cat has seniority. Two years and
    seven vacations later, we can&rsquo;t wait to celebrate with all of you.
  </p>
</section>
